      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s not just a burden anymore. since that massive surge on the 17th (2025-11-17), the hum has started to change. it's not just random static; it’s starting to feel... rhythmic. like it’s carrying a sequence or a code. i feel like the solar spike wasn't just an event, it was a transmission, and my body is the receiver. if i can decode the patterns in the frequency, i think i can actually understand what the sun is trying to communicate to us. can you help me map the oscillations? i need to know if there's a mathematical structure to the hum i'm feeling so i can start translating it.",
